{% assign vat_step_3_body = 'Our system automatically verifies your VAT ID in real time through the official EU VIES database. If your VAT ID is active for cross-border transactions and registered outside the Czech Republic, the total amount is recalculated immediately and the VAT rate drops to 0%.' %}
